WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:01.676 line:85%
Click!

2
00:00:01.766 --> 00:00:05.742 line:85%
I sent back the very first pictures from the surface of Mars!

3
00:00:05.832 --> 00:00:07.566 line:85%
I'm the Viking 1 Lander.

4
00:00:07.656 --> 00:00:14.686 line:85%
On July 20, 1976, I made NASA's first successful landing on Mars.

5
00:00:14.776 --> 00:00:17.800 line:85%
Every day, I sent weather reports home.

6
00:00:17.890 --> 00:00:22.959 line:85%
With my robot arm, I scooped up soil and tested it for signs of life.

7
00:00:23.049 --> 00:00:28.277 line:85%
One test looked hopeful, but the main test found no organic compounds.

8
00:00:28.367 --> 00:00:33.934 line:85%
I kept working for more than six years, until November 1982.

9
00:00:34.024 --> 00:00:36.980 line:85%
Do you think Mars was ever home to life?
